(
    title: "Spike\'s Peak",
    description: Some("Spike climbs five screens from the meadows up through rocky ledges and an icy snowfield to plant a flag on the summit, dodging eagles, bears, falling rocks and avalanches on the way. A bar under the score is his body temperature, shrinking as he climbs higher and colder — reach the top before it runs out, collecting gold nuggets and ice diamonds for points."),
